#: org.kde.accountwizard.appdata.xml:12
msgid ""
"Accountwizard allows to edit, create, delete accounts. Accountwizard supports"
" IMAP/POP3/Kolab account type. Account information can be found by using ispd"
" service."
msgstr ""
"O asistente de contas permite editar, crear e eliminar contas. Permite contas"
" de IMAP, POP3 e Kolab. A información da conta pode atoparse co servizo ispd."

